    "hub": {
      "text": "陆公子，周氏在哭，县里在催，我这顶小帽子快被雨泡软了。你要问就快，最好带着证据问。",
      "emotion": "nervous",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "你查清楚了？王大爷的证词站不住——好，好。那周氏那边我先稳住。你继续查。",
          "speaker_id": "li_zheng",
          "emotion": "determined",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "self_cleared"
            },
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵招了？陆公子，这事……沈家不好惹。您要是有实证，小人可以替您把人聚齐问话。",
          "speaker_id": "li_zheng",
          "emotion": "nervous",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "这件事你怎么看？",
          "goto": "intro",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "那片礁石，本地人都知道？",
          "goto": "ask_reef",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "lizheng_talked_once"
